  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONTINUED SUPPORT FOR RHINOCEROS MANAGEMENT OPERATIONS IN ZIMBABWE&apos;S LOWVELD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PURPOSE OF THIS PROJECT IS TO SUPPORT A CONSERVATION EFFORT IN THE LOWVELD REGION OF ZIMBABWE BY SUPPORTING MANAGEMENT OPERATIONS TO EXTEND AND SECURE THE RHINOCEROS RANGE. THIS PROJECT IS INTENDED TO CONSERVE BLACK RHINOCEROS AND THEIR HABITAT BY ADDRESSING RHINOCEROS HEALTH AND MONITORING. SPECIFIC ACTIVITIES INCLUDE: (1) PROVIDING VETERINARY INTERVENTIONS FOR RHINOCEROS AND (2) PURCHASING VEHICLE AND SUPPLIES FOR LONG- TERM POPULATION MONITORING.</narrative>
  </description>
